 has a strong maternal and chaotic personality.\n\nTop character: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J3DGe16HYIC7PUWbVRfK7oDcVYLsG73z/view?usp=sharing \nHer name is Rana Ianna. She is a dragon raid boss. She is very difficult to get along with.\n\nI would like to use her on YouTube/social media/merchandise. If possible, please separate the character and background as a .psd! Feel free to add poses and facial expressions if you like! Please do not cut off the head of the illustration. If possible, we would appreciate it if the dimensions of the illustration could be 16:9 (1920x1080 or larger).", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@chiitsune_/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2222911, "client_id": 1416113, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f1aa8580/uploads/origins/ed1956e5-9547-40bf-a69a-4a62a8ef402f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38d29b73267e9ad6082d72efc5afede3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f1aa8580/uploads/origins/ed1956e5-9547-40bf-a69a-4a62a8ef402f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38d29b73267e9ad6082d72efc5afede3, https://si.imgix.net/f1aa8580/uploads/origins/ed1956e5-9547-40bf-a69a-4a62a8ef402f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2fe8e23338c174576f10db261f74f89 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f1aa8580/uploads/origins/ed1956e5-9547-40bf-a69a-4a62a8ef402f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd9e818a453b0d2bbe21985f849793d9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f1aa8580/uploads/origins/ed1956e5-9547-40bf-a69a-4a62a8ef402f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=276f129b0c766b718846b7412410cb19", "srcset"